{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le05ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le05ob01re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn8le05ob01re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn8le05ob01re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>: \t\t\tHola, Miss ... ?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tI'm Vanessa. You must be Jose! I'm glad to finally meet you.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tIt is my pleasure to meet you too. Thank you for meeting me. I'm excited to start working in your restaurant. I didn't expect to get a job so fast.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tHiring the right people isn't easy, but I had a good feeling about your application. Judging from your CV, you seem to possess a strong work ethic.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn8le05ob01re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tThank you. I hope I have what it takes to become a member of your team. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tI'm sure you will. How long have you been in Cambridge?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tI arrived a few weeks ago. Traveling in the winter is very cold!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tWere you surprised to see so much snow when you got here?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tNot really. I read up on Boston's winters to prepare myself! I wanted to know what kind of adjustments I would need to make to my life here.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tThat was probably a good idea. Our summers make up for the cold, though. You'll see.", "id": 2, "time": "24000"}, {"image": "engenn8le05ob01re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tThat sounds good! My favorite hobbies are swimming and jogging.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tFantastic! Now, let me show you around. I want to see to it that you understand how everything works. Making sure that my staff are the best in town is something I take seriously.   <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tI understand. I'll keep at it.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tI'm sure you will. Now, if you'll excuse me, I need to carry on with today's tasks ...", "id": 3, "time": "53000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about manners and customs.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about life experiences. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about my attitudes toward an action. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you ever experienced a cold winter? How did you feel?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What is your favorite work environment? Home? School? A cafe? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Let's give a warm welcome to our new colleague! Moving to a new city in the winter isn't easy!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nJose is hired as a new waiter. Will he be able to <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">stand</span> Boston's cold winter?\n", "